{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25955","headline":"与峨眉山道士期尽日不至 · 鲍溶","name":"与峨眉山道士期尽日不至","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"倾景安再中，人生有何常。\n胡爲少君别，风驭峨眉阳。\n结我千日期，青山故人堂。\n期尽师不至，望云空烧香。\n顾慙有限身，易老白日光。\n怀君屡惊叹，支体安能强。\n往闻清修籙，未究服食方。\n瑶田有灵芝，眼见不得尝。\n玉壶贮天地，岁月亦已长。\n若用壶中景，东溟又堪伤。\n寄言赤玉箫，夜夜吹清商。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"鲍溶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25955.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25955","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}